nsumes all stacks on-attack to become a Headshot.","Headshot: Caitlyn's basic attack is empowered to have an uncancellable windup and deal 60% / 90% / 120% (based on level) (+ (148.75% + 34%) critical strike chance) AD bonus physical damage, increased to 110% / 115% / 120% (based on level) (+ (148.75% + 34%) critical strike chance) AD against non-champions.","Enemies that step over a Yordle Snap Trap or are hit by 90 Caliber Net can grant an additional Headshot against them at 1300 range within 1.8 seconds, without consuming stacks. Each method grants only one Headshot at a time."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"Piltover Peacemaker","rows":[{"attribute":"Physical Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[50,90,130,170,210],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[125,145,165,185,205],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Reduced Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[30,54,78,102,126],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[75,87,99,111,123],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]}],"damageType":"PHYSICAL_DAMAGE","effects":["Enemies revealed by Yordle Snap Trap always take full damage from Piltover Peacemaker."]}]},{"slot":"W","variants":[{"name":"Yordle Snap Trap","rows":[{"attribute":"Trap Duration","modifiers":[{"values":[30,35,40,45,50],"units":[" seconds"," seconds"," seconds"," seconds"," seconds"]}]},{"attribute":"Maximum Number of Traps","modifiers":[{"values":[3,3,4,4,5],"units":["","","","",""]}]},{"attribute":"Headshot Damage Increase","modifiers":[{"values":[35,80,125,170,215],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[30,30,30,30,30],"units":["% bonus AD","% bonus AD","% bonus AD","% bonus AD","% bonus AD"]}]}],"damageType":null,"effects":[]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"90 Caliber Net","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[80,130,180,230,280],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[80,80,80,80,80],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Caitlyn will not dash backwards if she is immobilized or grounded during the cast time. She can cast any of her abilities during the dash."]}]},{"slot":"R","variants":[{"name":"Ace in the Hole","rows":[{"attribute":"Physical damage","modifiers":[{"values":[300,475,650],"units":["","",""]},{"values":[100,100,100],"units":["% bonus AD","% bonus AD","% bonus AD"]}]}],"damageType":"PHYSICAL_DAMAGE","effects":["Active: Caitlyn locks onto the target enemy champion and channels for 1 second, revealing them as well as revealing herself.","Ace in the Hole is placed on a 5-second cooldown if canceled."]}]}],"formulaVersion":"15.15.1","history":[{"patch":"26.21","date":"2026-10-20","articleDate":"2026-10-20","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/league-of-legends-patch-26-21-notes/#patch-caitlyn","changes":[{"slot":"P","title":"기본 지속 효과 - 헤드샷","text":"피해량 : 공격력의 60~100% (+치명타 확률 1%당 공격력의 1%) (+추가 치명타 피해 1%당 공격력의 1%) ⇒ 공격력의 60~80% (+치명타 확률 1%당 공격력의 0.8%) (+추가 치명타 피해 1%당 공격력의 0.8%)","kind":"nerf"},{"slot":"Q","title":"Q - 필트오버 피스메이커","text":"기본 피해량 : 50/90/130/170/210 ⇒ 50/95/140/185/230","kind":"buff"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"26.1","date":"2026-01-07","articleDate":"2026-01-07","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/patch-26-1-notes/#patch-caitlyn","changes":[{"slot":"P","title":"기본 지속 효과 - 헤드샷","text":"치명타 계수 : 총공격력의 0~148.75/182.75% ⇒ 추가 치명타 피해량의 100% (총공격력의 0~100/130%)","kind":"adjust"},{"slot":"R","title":"R - 비장의 한 발","text":"치명타 계수 : 최대 1.5x ⇒ 추가 치명타 피해량의 30%: 최대 1.3x/무한의 대검 장착 시 1.39x","kind":"adjust"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"25.23","date":"2025-11-18","articleDate":"2025-11-18","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/patch-25-23-notes/#patch-caitlyn","changes":[{"slot":"P","title":"기본 지속 효과 - 헤드샷","text":"챔피언 대상 피해 증가량 : 총공격력의 60/90/120% ⇒ 총공격력의 60/80/100% (치명타 수식은 전과 동일)","kind":"nerf"},{"slot":"P","title":"기본 지속 효과 - 헤드샷","text":"챔피언이 아닌 유닛 대상 피해 증가량 : 총공격력의 110/115/120% ⇒ 총공격력의 110% (치명타 수식은